{"suttaId":"tha-ap186","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7068,7086],"vripara":"18"},"segments":{"tha-ap186:0.3":"Pañcahatthiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap186:1.1":"“Tisso nāmāsi bhagavā, lokajeṭṭho narāsabho;","tha-ap186:1.3":"Purakkhato sāvakehi, rathiyaṃ paṭipajjatha.","tha-ap186:2.1":"“Pañca uppalahatthā ca, cāturā ṭhapitā mayā;","tha-ap186:2.3":"Āhutiṃ dātukāmohaṃ, paggaṇhiṃ vatasiddhiyā [puttomhi hitasiddhiyā (syā.)].","tha-ap186:3.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, gacchantaṃ antarāpaṇe;","tha-ap186:3.3":"Buddharaṃsīhi phuṭṭhosmi [buddharaṃsyābhiphuṭṭhomhi (sī.), buddharaṃsābhighuṭṭhosmi (ka.)], pūjesiṃ dvipaduttamaṃ.","tha-ap186:4.1":"“Dvenavute ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap186:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap186:5.1":"“Ito terasakappamhi, pañca susabhasammatā;","tha-ap186:5.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap186:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap186:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pañcahatthiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap186:8.1":"Pañcahatthiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
